Please based on that sketch that I had written&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:29.920
two years prior and then throughout 2017 I&nbsp;
worked on the first draft in 2018 I worked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:37.520
