grows up to not fulfill her potential and I took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:52.800
that question and I asked okay what would be the&nbsp;
reasons why this would affect her in in not taking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.800 --> 00:03:01.120
a job somewhere in moving on with her life and and&nbsp;
I decided to answer those questions by oh it's her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:07.440
relationships with her family with her mom with&nbsp;
her dad with her brother and and her community&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:19.040
